! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''bi'u''

;__bi'u__ (UI3a):  Discursive.  Used to express new information {MORE DETAILS}.  This word comprises a scale, along with "OTHER1".  See also OTHER1, OTHER2, the preface. (cf. nindatni, saurdatni)
